{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stump Simulator 2 is a game in which you can become a tree stump. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will give you a meditative gameplay. You can stand and contemplate the beauty of the forest around you living your life as a tree stump. You can also perform actions that tree sumps usually perform (stand in the same place).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Canonical Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a tree stump </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in the forest </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other tree stumps around you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not only tree stumps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game mods: arcade and realistic</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic change of day and night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple control</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Stump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814040/4859da45491c9dd437a7f1102856cbe7ce915282.jpg"},{"name":"Ordinary Stump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814040/4a8f2190e68bc3275200798bf52746daad882a24.jpg"},{"name":"Unusual Stump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814040/aacc439f52a16d9d15578d896cc23c332181c1f5.jpg"},{"name":"Legend Stump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi